User: We lived for a week
 1. Bed linen was never changed (cleaning and change of towels daily);
 2. the number is microscopic. Rented Nissan Micra and then more;
 3. the refrigerator is full of minibar for money, I had to pull everything out so that my products would fit;
 4. the hotel did not allow to turn over a couple of hours before the delayed plane;
 5. walk to the promenade of Larnaca for about 20 minutes, to Lidl for an hour and a half.
 The hotel is really for one night.

